how to get more confidence  the best way that i know how to get more  confidence is to start small usually if  you are unconfident in something it's  because  it's this big scary thing  that you've never done before i've never  had any success with before and because  it's so big and scary you doubt yourself  and you're not confident in your ability  to do it  and it it can be paralyzing and it shuts  you down the best way that i found that  helps me to be able to go out  and be confident in the things that i'm  doing is i start small i take that big  project  and i take it into small little pieces  and try to figure out okay that's my  long-term vision that's i'd love for  that to happen  but what's like the next little step  that i can take because that little step  is not as scary  and if i can do that then i know i can  do that step over and over and over  again and then i'm willing to go to the  next step and the next step and the next  step  some people  some people don't have this problem some  people are just overly confident all the  time  and  they just jump into new things  that's not me and that's not a lot of  people so if you're like that you could  turn off the video because it's not for  you  but if you are that kind of person and  you don't always have tons of confidence  going into every single situation  you can build up your muscle  by taking it into small steps because  the first time you do anything can be  scary and when it's scary you're unsure  the outcome you're unsure of your  abilities you don't have the confidence  but once you do it then you know you can  do it again and again and again you  could go one step up further  i got a great question from one of my  youtube viewers  mike who wrote in with a huge long  message thank you mike we gotta we gotta  work on cutting down our messages but  but it was a great email  basically wrote in to say he's  part of this life insurance company okay  he's got a brokerage him and his  father-in-law have this brokerage  together he's he's got 350 people under  him and his father-in-law wants him to  eventually take over the business  and mike is afraid that  he doesn't have what it takes to make  big decisions he's 26 years old i think  and he's afraid of taking over this  business and he's afraid to go talk to  his father-in-law to say hey  i don't know if i can handle this  mike  it's great that you're actually scared  here because  it shows that you care  it shows that you really care about the  350 people  who are under you and their livelihood  right you don't want to make the wrong  decision that could impact all of their  lives right put them out of business and  and make them go look for new jobs  so it's great and and that  that caring and compassion is a great  place to start  with for you to get more confidence  start making little decisions now  take over little chunks instead of  making these big wide ranging decisions  and having everything fall on your plate  have a transition period where you start  making more and more decisions and you  have your father-in-law as guidance  along the way in any major corporation  the person who becomes ceo doesn't just  become ceo overnight there's a grooming  process  they're trained they work with the ceo  they're mentored and they start taking  on responsibilities bit by bit by bit so  when they have the role they're  confident in it  so i'd encourage you to do the same  thing  and you could tell your father-in-law  and i wouldn't be too afraid to bring it  up  let him know that you you  are interested in this but you're  worried  and you want his help to train you to be  better and start taking on smaller  projects that work up to become bigger  projects  so the next time that comes up you're  able to handle it you have the  confidence to know that you can do it  okay it's believing in yourself and that  comes from getting some experience i  remember when i first started  doing videos  i was scared i was nervous that the  first videos were not great  i wanted to get into videos it was it  was a good reason i loved watching  videos i learned visually so i wanted to  create videos to help entrepreneurs it  was something i was passionate about  i just didn't have the confidence and i  wasn't really good at it and if you look  at my first videos they were they  weren't great they're still up on  youtube you can go back and watch them  they weren't fantastic  and  the first videos i made  i had to summon a lot of courage to do  it because standing in front of a camera  and knowing that what you record is  going to go out to millions of people  and being like public domain that was  scary and so i had to have things go a  certain way i had to be alone nobody  could be around me i had to have my  drink i had to have prepared and i did  so many takes it took me the whole day  to do one video  but i did it you know it wasn't great  but i did it and i knew that i could do  that again  and so i did it again and again and i  got better and better and better and  each time up the game a little bit  so now it doesn't matter if there's  people in the room it doesn't matter if  my day's gone a certain way it doesn't  take me all afternoon to make one video  but i couldn't have gone  from where i was to where i am now  without going through all those steps  and each step gave me confidence to take  the next step and the next step  i know it can be scary i know for any of  you who are watching who have  you have a goal that you want to reach  but it requires you jumping through a  lot of scary hoops and doing things that  are way outside your comfort zone  don't let that hold you back  don't let that hold you back from being  a great entrepreneur and helping a lot  of people  you can overcome those fears  and the best way again i know how to do  it is step by step so just break that  down into the smallest possible step and  start building momentum and start  getting better and better and as you  look back you'll say wow what what kind  of progress i just made on that  you'll shock yourself  and you make it a lot less scary it  gives you the confidence and motivation  to keep going  believe  those are watching you like the video  thumbs up below i love seeing them come  in and i want to hear what you have to  think do you have confidence you have  issues with your confidence can i answer  a question for you please leave it below  in the comments section it's the best  part of my day of seeing those comments  come in so thank you so much guys and  i'll see you soon  you

